# The raw camera originals stay here as local masters but are never committed
# or deployed — they are 848x480 h264+aac, ~14.6MB total, and every byte the
# site actually serves comes from the web derivatives listed below. Re-run the
# recipe in docs/factory-video-assets.md to regenerate them from the masters.
#
# hero-corrugation / coil-feed / sheet-inspection / coil-stock-loop feed the
# hero background slideshow (components/hero-slideshow.tsx). cut-to-length /
# coil-stock feed the contained-panel placements further down the page
# (components/factory-video.tsx).
*

!.gitignore
!hero-corrugation.mp4
!hero-corrugation.jpg
!coil-feed.mp4
!coil-feed.jpg
!sheet-inspection.mp4
!sheet-inspection.jpg
!coil-stock-loop.mp4
!coil-stock-loop.jpg
!cut-to-length.mp4
!cut-to-length.jpg
!coil-stock.mp4
!coil-stock.jpg

# Gerard roofing nails campaign: 720x1280 derivatives of public/t (see
# lib/videos-data.ts). Masters are gitignored at the repo root.
!gerard-nails-*.mp4
!gerard-nails-*.jpg
